Subject: [PATCH] videodec: require Cedar picture leases and cedardispsink

Require the native Cedar descriptor ABI; no pixel conversion fallback.
Release picture leases only after display completion.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [Miyoo F1C100s private display ABI]

--- a/omx/gstomxvideodec.c
+++ b/omx/gstomxvideodec.c
@@ -1,3 +1,4 @@
+#include "cedar-display.h"
